{
  "_comment": [
    "One entry per brand. Replaces four legacy maps that had to be kept in sync by hand:",
    "fetch_shopify.js STORES, clean.js STORE_BRAND + SUB_BRANDS, amazon_prepare.js ALIASES,",
    "amazon_clean.js BRAND_NAME. Fields:",
    "  brand        canonical display name, the only brand string that reaches a snapshot",
    "  shopify      store domain whose whole catalog is this brand (drives the fetch list)",
    "  amazonBrand  the amazon.in brand-facet string to search (&rh=p_89%3A<this>)",
    "  amazonFiles  raw-pull file slugs that belong to this brand (keyword pulls included)",
    "  aliases      lowercase match tokens; a raw Amazon row is off-brand unless brand+title",
    "               contains one of them. Also used to spot a sub-brand inside another store.",
    "  subBrands    brands sold inside this store that must NOT inherit the store's brand",
    "  subBrandOnly true when the brand has no store and no Amazon pull of its own: it is only",
    "               ever detected by alias inside another brand's store (legacy SUB_BRANDS)",
    "  note         why the brand is Amazon-only / store has no supplements, where it matters"
  ],
